---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q14"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: Float64(100) * CAST(sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount ELSE Int64(0) END) AS Float64) / CAST(sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount) AS Float64) AS promo_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |  Projection: sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount) ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: lineitem.l_partkey = part.p_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       TableScan: lineitem projection=[l_partkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount], full_filters=[lineitem.l_shipdate >= CAST(Utf8("1995-09-01") AS Date32), lineitem.l_shipdate < CAST(Utf8("1995-10-01") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       TableScan: part projection=[p_partkey, p_type]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[100 * CAST(sum(CASE WHEN part.p_type LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount ELSE Int64(0) END)@0 AS Float64) / CAST(sum(lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - lineitem.l_discount)@1 AS Float64) as promo_revenue]                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(16), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=:memory: base_sql=SELECT sum(CASE WHEN "part"."p_type" LIKE 'PROMO%' THEN ("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount")) ELSE 0 END), sum(("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount"))) FROM "lineitem" INNER JOIN "part" ON ("lineitem"."l_partkey" = "part"."p_partkey") WHERE ("lineitem"."l_shipdate" >= CAST('1995-09-01' AS DATE)) AND ("lineitem"."l_shipdate" < CAST('1995-10-01' AS DATE)) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
